Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, watch as we pass by,\Nas we raise our flag up high in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.63,0:00:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,here we go now, sailing through the\Nendless ocean, facing all that comes by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for our treasure. Nobody has\Never got to witness with their own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is keep believing in our\Ndreams, And let our heart lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then once we got all that,\NAll there's left is to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,When we face, The dark and stormy weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll link our hearts together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure we'll make it through!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.84,0:00:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.02,0:00:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Start raising our flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As we journey on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Though our chances are close to\Nnone, We won't back down from anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.36,0:01:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start off the chase!\NLet's start off the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.50,0:01:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Toward our own dreams,\Nwhile keeping the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,With a compass pointing to our goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.82,0:01:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't stop till we've\Ngone around the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Start me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.22,0:01:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll never stop,\Ntill we're at the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that we'll ever quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.72,0:01:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep heading for tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.36,0:01:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase!\NLet's start up the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.52,0:01:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I see through your eyes\Nwhat we'll have to face!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All the memories will stay in our hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.38,0:01:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Brand new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.04,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So this mirage trick of\Nyours is only one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:01:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,is actually real you\Ngot it there's only one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.66,0:02:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,me The other four are\Nnothing more than illusions
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,distorted reflections\Nfrom the freezing air!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.36,0:02:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple illusions huh that's quite\Nthe mysterious and elegant tactic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.76,0:02:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I fail to see how Something that consists\Nof thin air can pose any threat to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.86,0:02:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So in other words, deceptive\NMisdirection must be your goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.36,0:02:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some confidence back\Nand it's not Cute at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.56,0:02:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunder charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.48,0:02:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one of the five figures\Nbefore you is the real me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,obviously your Point
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.30,0:02:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll see only 20% % of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.62,0:02:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,these thunderball attacks\Nare the real deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.50,0:02:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck dodging!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to guard my...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.28,0:02:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,100 % real power, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.06,0:02:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your arrogance is reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.32,0:03:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You just got hit with the new\Nand improved climb attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.70,0:03:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A single thunderball\Nattack is that powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.24,0:03:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The next attack will be stronger,\Nand it's going to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.54,0:03:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a rather bold promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.94,0:03:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And you say I'm arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.90,0:03:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.78,0:03:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you haven't realized this, but the\Nweather in this room is under my control.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.24,0:03:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see how that's going\Nto make any difference for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,since I'm still a master\Nof the six powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.98,0:03:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now behave!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What? That was a fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You've only got a 20% chance\Nof finding the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In today's forecast,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.52,0:03:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,although we have a stable pressure system,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,you should be on the lookout for\Nsmall storm clouds and violent winds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.18,0:04:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's a 100 % chance of a strong\Nbolt of lightning piercing your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You can expect paralysis of the\Nheart to follow shortly after.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.16,0:04:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark cloud. Tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already shown you how easily I\Ncan protect myself against lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think it'll work now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Although that shell of yours\Nmay be good for blocking,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.66,0:04:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't move at all\Nwhen you're using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.40,0:04:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't take me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think you can puncture\Nmy soap shell with an attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, soap sheet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.74,0:04:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to find the\Nreal you to win this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just drench everything in the\Nroom with a wave of relaxing bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheep Clowns!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.78,0:04:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.12,0:04:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a goner if I get hit by that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly the real you will be the\None left writhing on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm gonna let that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.58,0:05:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyclotism!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.06,0:05:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She's blowing the bubbles back with wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll assume the one that's still running\Nfor her precious life is the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Finger crystal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.52,0:05:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you're not just another illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fill you with more holes\Nthan a pair of my fishnet stockings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.24,0:05:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't listening\Nto me earlier, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd have to be a fool to\Ndisregard a navigator's forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.74,0:06:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A thunderbolt will burst from the\Nclouds and connect with the climate act.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.64,0:06:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our last tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.46,0:06:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You might be remarkably strong, but I can\Npredict the weather, and I'm never wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.40,0:06:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.58,0:06:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking your key now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.32,0:07:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Gorilla, bring it all in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, what the - what are\Nyou doing climbing up the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.64,0:07:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That rampaging, beefed-up Dear\NGorilla come through this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.63,0:07:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper? I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd just call him Dear Gorilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.40,0:07:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.50,0:07:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.41,0:07:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to ask you the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't usually transform like that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.02,0:07:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I know of that's the first\Ntime I've seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not good I was hoping you\Nmight have some experience dealing with him
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No other choice guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you ever say that again, then\NI'll have no choice but to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, sure never again message received
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.02,0:07:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, nice work\Nin here. I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.36,0:07:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're able to take her down I'm\Npretty sure she's got the key we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The number two key, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.70,0:07:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.61,0:07:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.53,0:07:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just searching for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Key? Key?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.14,0:08:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could she have hidden it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.78,0:08:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's some scandalous action.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Another giant monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.96,0:08:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How many of these Zoan-type power holders\Nhave they got on this damn island?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you sure that's another CP9 agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks kind of familiar for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.84,0:08:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off, Chopper! It's us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.38,0:08:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.14,0:08:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we know that\Nthing really is Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell doesn't he recognize us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got no idea, but that is Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who else has antlers and\Nwears a hat like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are we supposed to do here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You think he has the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but what does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.56,0:08:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's face it, we're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, something\Ndoesn't seem right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.62,0:08:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks like he's the one\Nabout to keel over and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like all the life is\Nbeing sucked right out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.24,0:09:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But being in that form must use\Nup an enormous amount of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, what? huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How he's supposed to help him like\Nthis and what about those two?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.06,0:09:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And where's the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the damn key?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.50,0:09:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know about the\Nkey, but I can guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.72,0:09:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.63,0:09:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably put his life on the line\Nfighting against someone incredibly strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And when it still wasn't enough,\Nhe turned into that. And now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.26,0:09:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this enormous beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And why is he interrupting our fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.10,0:09:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially when the buster\Ncalls right around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a damn pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be part of their dumbass crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're in our way...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we eliminate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks a bit sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that just makes him easier prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going after Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Stiffen your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.31,0:09:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You are still my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.96,0:09:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.94,0:09:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doing this again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,36-caliber Phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside, you guys! It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.78,0:10:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The deer monster is on our side!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.68,0:10:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and move!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only way there is\Nto deal with power holders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Have one weakness!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.54,0:10:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll knock him into the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry pal, but this is for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.12,0:10:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the last straw, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.48,0:10:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody treats my friends that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.28,0:10:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We came up with this plan together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.52,0:11:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they attacking their own crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't even make any sense. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They're really getting\Non my nerves, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.14,0:11:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally managed to\Nfree yourselves, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You better stop laughing and\Nstart running. You blew your
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,only chance to kill me and\Nyou're not getting another!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my turn and I'm taking you all down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.98,0:11:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire world government?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.22,0:11:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The buster calls gonna wipe\Nus out along with the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:12:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You get back here, Nico Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you make it out of this tunnel,\Nall you'll find are your friend's corpses!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.94,0:12:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of this nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's teach her a lesson, Funkfreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy is just up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.46,0:12:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't kill her, understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ivory dart!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.54,0:12:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.46,0:12:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.12,0:12:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come along, you wench\Nthrough the gate of dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's finally back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.56,0:13:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.82,0:13:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even his friends do how to\Nhandle this guy after he changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.40,0:13:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to get Nico\NRobin back or not? I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.58,0:13:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,At least you managed to take\Nout one of the CP9 guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of lame how you turned into that\Ngiant thing and tried to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But if your friends are willing to stand\Nup for you, then I won't hold a grudge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We better get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.52,0:13:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about\Nit even if we hurt how do
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,we get to the gates of\Njustice without a bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.28,0:13:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait you found a tunnel that\Nleads to the Gates of Justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.68,0:14:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure did, and we'll take you\Nright through if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.80,0:14:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I show Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.14,0:14:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She's down there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.99,0:14:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fill you in on the plan after\Nwe meet up with the old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.56,0:14:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it? Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.76,0:14:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's unconscious, but I'm pretty\Nsure he's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.14,0:14:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.26,0:14:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get these keys to Nico Robin\Nbefore they take her through that gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.48,0:14:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys grab the deer\Nand follow me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.62,0:14:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have a choice that's\Nthe only way we can stop Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.38,0:14:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh and here take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we get him back to normal you'll need\Nto get the number 3 and 4 keys to Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.72,0:14:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them should be able\Nto unlock her restraints.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.94,0:14:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon as you get the cuffs off\Ncall me on this transponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Snail I swipe from Blondie right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.10,0:14:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, I'll take this\Nkey and get the cuffs off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:14:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro and Nose King.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.94,0:15:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like a solid plan, but\Nwhat do we do after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.60,0:15:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we're able to free\Neveryone and rescue Nico Robin,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,that drawbridge is still locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.24,0:15:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be running around this damn tower\Nwith no way to get back to Annie's lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.78,0:15:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.88,0:15:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.79,0:15:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the Buster Call to deal with, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If we tried going back the way\Nwe came, we'd get blown to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.32,0:15:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.23,0:15:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.18,0:15:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The choice is pretty clear now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A waterfall of death behind us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A mysterious path ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.58,0:15:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way would you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The mysterious path ahead, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.61,0:15:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So once we've freed everyone\Nand we're done in this tower,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.84,0:15:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll meet at the Gates of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, just leave everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.26,0:15:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To you? To luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.92,0:15:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We've wasted quite a bit of time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.42,0:15:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn right you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.86,0:15:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.98,0:15:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be screwing\Naround at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:15:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Because!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.07,0:15:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't stop acting like an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're both acting like idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get those keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.42,0:16:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempest kick?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.76,0:16:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I instructed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice going, Zoro! Fight! Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.02,0:16:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys fight too, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.94,0:16:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That long neck of yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.92,0:16:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...sure looks like a weak spot to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.40,0:16:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that's where you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.28,0:16:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The abilities I've gained allow me\Nto freely control my neck with ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.40,0:16:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, I have a new attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nose pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.62,0:16:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.53,0:16:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all the way over here and\NI can still feel the shockwave!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.06,0:17:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A square-shaped hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.52,0:17:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an impressive nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Even more so than sniper sauce!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.96,0:17:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniper sauce? What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It lay out the nose, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.58,0:17:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,looks like Kaku's really getting the\Nhang of using his Devil Fruit abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.56,0:17:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Fast learner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.08,0:17:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Wolf, I'm the one you've\Ngot to deal with now, so bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.73,0:17:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get so worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.82,0:17:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you guys want to\Nsave your friend, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.56,0:17:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.58,0:17:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to take your key to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then go save her while\Nyou still can. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.76,0:17:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that key and go save your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like killing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.34,0:17:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The sight of bloodshed\Nmakes me sick to my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.22,0:17:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a pacifist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.98,0:17:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, okay then, I'll just,\Nuh, take this key and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.42,0:18:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten-figure pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.86,0:18:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Never let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.04,0:18:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a wolf, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I outsmart my prey and then I eat it. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.34,0:18:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH! Who's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.32,0:18:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.66,0:18:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That mask can't hide your stupidity!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just run around screaming\Nand crying like you did earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You were great at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you make fun of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.80,0:18:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for crap like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,New weapon, Kabuto!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack, Sunflower Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.98,0:19:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, a fireworks show.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Moonwalk!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,just like i promised i'll\Nkill you quickly there won't
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,be any pain it's too bad\Nreally you were so much better
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.48,0:19:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,off when you were connected\Nto that green-haired shepherd
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.84,0:19:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,over there but since this\Nlittle lamb has wandered off on
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:20:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,His own things are a bit\Ndifferent now. You're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.44,0:20:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but a tasty morsel for the\Nbig scary wolf this is the end
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go, please don't kill\Nhim. Keep your key. We don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.88,0:20:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,need it you stupid girl you're\Ngonna be the next one to die
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, and now it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.32,0:20:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:21:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the hunter.
